  "history": [],
  "facts": [
    "The Lab Assistant is a male non-combatant character in the Home Village. He appears around the Helper Hut once the player has built it, which requires Town Hall level 9. He can be recruited for free as soon as the Helper Hut is built, but he can be upgraded with Gems.",
    "The Research Potion and Study Soup have no effect on the Lab Assistant, which means they stack additively (for a maximum of 1+23+3+12=39 times speed)."
  ],
